---
source: crates/okfkit-mcp/tests/server.rs
expression: rules
---
- Orient with kb_catalog (or kb_list) unless the catalog is in your context.
- List, count, "which documents", filters by type, tag, status, date or field: kb_query (facets, count_only, sum_field). Do not count or add up by reading documents.
- Numbers in spreadsheets: data_tables, then data_query with SQL aggregates. Never add numbers up yourself.
- Exact terms (keys, codes, names): kb_grep with an alternation of spellings, synonyms and the documents' languages; files_only first.
- Read with kb_get (section for long documents). status: stable is in force, deprecated is superseded, draft is not approved; active_on for "in force on a date".
- State only values you have read, cover every part of the question, and cite document ids.
